Enraged Indrajit springs on black horse chariot seizing huge bow --- Indrajit boasts arrows will shred limbs and send all to Yama --- Lakṣmaṇa scorns wordy crossing and demands deed in arrow range --- Indrajit looses snake venom shafts bloodying Lakṣmaṇa like smokeless fire --- Indrajit roars jackals will seize corpse and Rāma mourn brother --- Lakṣmaṇa vows silent killing without harsh words --- Lakṣmaṇa plants five shafts in chest as foe pierces back with three --- Matched lions shower arrow masses like rain clouds joyfully
